abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for a frozen ridge-logistic five-minute landmark
  model developed in INSPIRE and externally evaluated without updating in
  MOVER. The release contains code, model and preprocessing metadata,
  protocol materials, synthetic numerical verification, and non-patient-level
  aggregate source-data CSV files, and programmatically generated figures. It
  excludes source data and patient-level derivatives.
